message: >-
  If you use SpectralAudit in scientific research, academic publications,
  datasets, benchmarks, or technical reports, please cite Eduardo J. Barrios
  using the citation provided by this file and identify the software version.
type: software
title: 'SpectralAudit: Explainable Spectral Forensics for Music'
authors:
  - family-names: Barrios
    given-names: Eduardo J.
version: 0.2.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/edujbarrios/spectralaudit
url: https://github.com/edujbarrios/spectralaudit
keywords:
  - music information retrieval
  - digital signal processing
  - audio forensics
  - synthetic music artifacts
  - mastering
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python software for offline, reproducible spectral measurements,
  heuristic periodicity analysis, and persistent high-frequency artifact diagnostics.
